cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the registry tooling, cite this repository. If you use a published
  registry snapshot, also cite the exact snapshot tag and commit as documented
  in docs/CITATION.md. Always cite upstream datasets separately when required.
type: software
title: "Data Registry"
abstract: >-
  Provenance-first research dataset registry and reproducibility tooling for
  canonical datasets, external source records, immutable snapshot manifests,
  and legacy data quarantine.
authors:
